\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces CAP-KVC architecture. A background sweep scores five pre-written contexts from GPS, BLE and time, keeps up to three of them as primed KV state in llama.cpp sequence slots, and saves each state to disk. An interaction shows a canned reply, then resumes the highest-ranked resident context and decodes only the intent; if none is resident, priming starts in the background. Slot~3 serves inline inference without disturbing resident states.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{3}{CAP-KVC architecture. A background sweep scores five pre-written contexts from GPS, BLE and time, keeps up to three of them as primed KV state in llama.cpp sequence slots, and saves each state to disk. An interaction shows a canned reply, then resumes the highest-ranked resident context and decodes only the intent; if none is resident, priming starts in the background. Slot~3 serves inline inference without disturbing resident states}{figure.1}{}}
